title: "dmp-hpc-template: a short form about the data of projects that use high-performance computing at IT:U"
abstract: >-
  A page for describing the data of a project that uses high-performance
  computing at IT:U: the project, its datasets, the storage it needs on the
  cluster and three questions. The form is
  downloaded as a document and as hpc-template.json, a format of its own. It is
  a draft prepared by DART and has not been adopted as IT:U policy. Derived
  from the IT:U data management plan page, which is built on Actionable DMP.
  It runs at https://rijdho.github.io/dmp-hpc-template/.
